ent-EmergencyChestInjector = chest emergency injector
    .desc = A reusable jumpsuit-mounted injector with a 20-unit reagent reservoir. Once armed manually, it injects its entire contents when its wearer enters critical condition. Removing the jumpsuit or changing the contents disarms it.
ent-ToolSelectionBracelet = tool selection bracelet
    .desc = A wrist controller with six bindings for tools and medical supplies in your worn belt or bag. Attaches to gloves without replacing their properties, or occupies the gloves slot. It has no storage of its own.
ent-ActionEmergencyChestInjector = Emergency injector
    .desc = Arm or disarm the chest emergency injector.
ent-ActionToolSelectionBracelet = Tools and medical supplies
    .desc = Open the tool selection bracelet.
